uplink-bow-bundle-desc = The Phantom Menace: A compound bow made by Cybersun, supplied with a quiver of arrows.
uplink-bow-bundle-name = Compound bow bundle
uplink-bow-compound-red-desc = Stained with the blood of greytiders. A lightweight bow that pairs well with armor-piercing arrows. Can be upgraded with C4.
uplink-bow-compound-red-name = Blood-red compound bow
uplink-bundle-kr51-desc = The Phantom Menace: Classic KR51 rifle, comes with 3 magazines.
uplink-bundle-kr51-name = KR51 bundle
uplink-clothing-pnv-desc = A night vision device.
uplink-clothing-pnv-name = Night vision goggles
uplink-eswords-desc = Two energy swords with properties similar to a double-bladed energy sword.
uplink-eswords-name = energy swords
uplink-gygax-desc = A Syndicate repaint of the Gygax. It is battered and badly worn, but still functions normally—just like after the last corporate war.
uplink-gygax-syndie-name = Syndicate Gygax combat mech
